  "items": [
    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-5-1",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod5-Q1",
        "itemBody": "<p>The annual returns for three portfolios are shown in the following table. Portfolios P and R were created in Year 1. Portfolio Q was created in Year 2. Annual Portfolio Returns (%) Year 1 Year 2 Year 3 Year 4 Year 5 Portfolio P −3.0 4.0 5.0 3.0 7.0 Portfolio Q NA −3.0 6.0 4.0 8.0 Portfolio R 1.0 −1.0 4.0 4.0 3.0 The median annual return from the time the portfolio is created to Year 5 for:</p>",
        "feedback": {
          "neutral": ""
        },
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "cf76f8ec-6516-4667-8492-be4ee1d35026",
              "itemBody": "<p>A. Portfolio P is 4.5%.</p>",
              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "2a6624da-902f-4b30-b80e-f28b9b5a9e2e",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. Portfolio Q is 4.0%.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "da8bb997-f80e-4f5d-aada-9e2efd8fd28e",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. Portfolio R is higher than its arithmetic annual return.</p>",
              "position": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "scoringData": {
          "value": "cf76f8ec-6516-4667-8492-be4ee1d35026"
        },
        "properties": {
