    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-5-9",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod5-Q9",
        "itemBody": "<p>For a positively skewed unimodal distribution, which of the following measures is most accurately described as the largest?</p>",
