    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-5-10",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod5-Q10",
        "itemBody": "<p>The figure below shows the histogram for the distribution of weekly returns on an index. The median of the returns on the index, if compared to the mean, will most likely be:</p>",
