              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "1f9ef242-c379-4d05-af42-f459915a4102",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. frequent small losses and a few extreme gains.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "79980128-ee63-409d-90a0-f6256055fed5",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. frequent extreme losses and a few small gains.</p>",
