    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-5-13",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod5-Q13",
        "itemBody": "<p>If the covariance between two positively correlated random variables remains the same but the variance of both variables increases, the correlation between the two variables:</p>",
