        "itemBody": "<p>A risk manager would like to calculate the coefficient of variation of a portfolio. The following table reports the annual returns of the portfolio and of the risk-free rate over the most recent five years: Year Portfolio Return Risk-Free Rate 1 4.0% 2.0% 2 –1.0% 1.5% 3 7.0% 1.0% 4 11.0% 1.0% 5 2.0% 0.5% The coefficient of variation of the portfolio is closest to:</p>",
