            {
              "id": "546dea55-0ba0-412e-84e9-884fbf0ee5ab",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. mean excess return earned per unit of risk.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "8ac8cf99-e798-4dc0-828d-98048001addf",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. average absolute deviation around the mean return.</p>",
